    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Amidst the vastness of space, cries for help can be easily unheard, and dangers lurk in every corner. You play as an astronaut in search of parts to repair your ship and stumble upon an abandoned space station. Explore the decrepit station, brave its terrors, unravel its mysteries, and secure the necessary components to save yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate the dark, and discover new items across the space station that can be used to enhance your exploration, or perhaps repair your ship. Use every resource available to progress further and discover more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for your Survival</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the cramped spaces of an abandoned space station fight off the monsters that lurk in the dark. Don't spend all your bullets at once, every shot is one less for your next fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >May the light guide you</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enemies are sensitive to light, utilize the power of flares and light to combat your enemies, and hold back the encroaching darkness. Venture forth and prepare to face the countless enemies of this dark space station and discover its hidden secrets.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/b61855932ac0a1a087db30ce578ab0a5.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Amidst the vastness of space, cries for help can be easily unheard, and dangers lurk in every corner. You play as an astronaut in search of parts to repair your ship and stumble upon an abandoned space station. Explore the decrepit station, brave its terrors, unravel its mysteries, and secure the necessary components to save yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f81a5f6c9fd9a9538c610de6744a1555.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate the dark, and discover new items across the space station that can be used to enhance your exploration, or perhaps repair your ship. Use every resource available to progress further and discover more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for your Survival</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/f143b131afebe177e1b968597c7085db.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the cramped spaces of an abandoned space station fight off the monsters that lurk in the dark. Don't spend all your bullets at once, every shot is one less for your next fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >May the light guide you</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.poster.avif?t=1704916277\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.webm?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603770/extras/a96afa843d3a4a580e6e618bc5dae4e6.mp4?t=1704916277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enemies are sensitive to light, utilize the power of flares and light to combat your enemies, and hold back the encroaching darkness. Venture forth and prepare to face the countless enemies of this dark space station and discover its hidden secrets.",
